    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An action racing game, whose gameplay is roughly divided into &quot;melee mode&quot; and &quot;Boss Mode&quot;. In the &quot;Close Combat Mode&quot;, players need to attack the specified type of enemies by pressing the designated keys. In the &quot;Boss Mode&quot;, players need to attack the enemies with firearms. The faster you kill the enemies in the game, the higher the rewards you will get. Players can also obtain different attribute effects by changing different weapons and treasures of their characters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1. Game mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1) Melee mode: Players need to attack designated types of enemies by pressing the specified keys. For example, the &quot;W&quot; key can only attack red enemies, and the &quot;D&quot; key can only attack yellow enemies, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2) Boss Mode: Players need to attack enemies with firearms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2. Weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons are mainly divided into melee weapons and firearms. Players can freely combine weapons of different qualities and types.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3. Treasure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can add some different types of treasures to the treasure slot to obtain different attribute effects.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An action racing game, whose gameplay is roughly divided into &quot;melee mode&quot; and &quot;Boss Mode&quot;. In the &quot;Close Combat Mode&quot;, players need to attack the specified type of enemies by pressing the designated keys. In the &quot;Boss Mode&quot;, players need to attack the enemies with firearms. The faster you kill the enemies in the game, the higher the rewards you will get. Players can also obtain different attribute effects by changing different weapons and treasures of their characters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1. Game mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1) Melee mode: Players need to attack designated types of enemies by pressing the specified keys. For example, the &quot;W&quot; key can only attack red enemies, and the &quot;D&quot; key can only attack yellow enemies, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2) Boss Mode: Players need to attack enemies with firearms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2. Weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons are mainly divided into melee weapons and firearms. Players can freely combine weapons of different qualities and types.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3. Treasure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can add some different types of treasures to the treasure slot to obtain different attribute effects.</p>",
